          "answer": "你说什么？ (Nǐ shuō shénme?) — What did you say?",
          "explanation": "One natural model response; alternatives that express the same meaning are possible."
        },
        {
          "id": "q-speaking",
          "kind": "production",
          "prompt": "Tell someone you do not understand and ask what they said.",
          "choices": [],
          "correct_choice_ids": [],
          "answer": "A: 你明白吗？ (Nǐ míngbai ma?) — Do you understand?\nB: 我不明白。你说什么？ (Wǒ bù míngbai. Nǐ shuō shénme?) — I do not understand. What did you say?\nA: 我说我们明天见。 (Wǒ shuō wǒmen míngtiān jiàn.) — I said we will see each other tomorrow.\nB: 好，我明白了。谢谢！ (Hǎo, wǒ míngbai le. Xièxie!) — Okay, now I understand. Thank you!",
          "explanation": "Complete sample role-play. practice both speakers, then substitute your own details."
        }
      ]
    }
